#: manual/index.md:38
msgid "Theory"
msgstr "理论"

#: manual/index.md:40
msgid "The treatise below develops the type theory behind stella, from the untyped lambda calculus to Martin-Löf type theory, and explains how the kernel elaborates it. Read it as the narrative overview before working on elaboration details or extending the proof language."
msgstr "下面的论述从无类型 lambda 演算一路发展到 Martin-Löf 类型论，阐述 stella 背后的类型理论，并说明内核如何对其进行 elaboration。在深入 elaboration 细节或扩展证明语言之前，请先把它当作整体概述来阅读。"

#: manual/index.md:42
msgid "[Foundations and Elaboration of Stella Based on Dependent Type Theory](../attachments/stella_foundations.typ)"
msgstr "[基于依值类型论的 Stella 基础与 Elaboration](../attachments/stella_foundations.typ)"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:1
msgid "elab tutorial"
msgstr "elab 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to write terms of stella's type theory as MoonBit values, ask the kernel for their types, check them against types you give, and compute their normal forms. It starts with the identity function and ends with a proof by path induction. The typing rules behind each step are in the [design notes](../design/elab.md)."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何将 stella 类型论的项写成 MoonBit 值、向内核询问它们的类型、对照你给出的类型检查它们，以及计算它们的范式。教程从恒等函数开始，以一个路径归纳证明结束。每一步背后的类型规则见[设计说明](../design/elab.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:5
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:7
msgid "Add the module to your project:"
msgstr "将模块添加到你的项目："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:13
msgid "Import the package and the list package, which provides contexts and environments, in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包以及提供上下文和环境的 list 包："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:22
msgid "The smallest useful program type-checks the identity function on the unit type and applies it:"
msgstr "最小的有用程序对单位类型上的恒等函数做类型检查并应用它："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:37
msgid "Three ideas appear here. A function `Lam` has no domain annotation, so the kernel cannot infer its type; `Ann` supplies the type. `type_inf_0` returns the type as a *value*, and `quote(0, _)` turns a value back into a term you can print. `eval_inf` computes, and the application reduces to `UnitElement`."
msgstr "这里出现了三个要点。函数 `Lam` 没有定义域标注，因此内核无法推断其类型；`Ann` 提供了类型。`type_inf_0` 以*值*的形式返回类型，`quote(0, _)` 将值转回可打印的项。`eval_inf` 进行计算，应用归约为 `UnitElement`。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:39
msgid "Everyday tasks"
msgstr "日常任务"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:41
msgid "Read and write de Bruijn indices"
msgstr "读写德布鲁因索引"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:43
msgid "Variables are numbers: `Bound(0)` is the variable of the nearest enclosing binder, `Bound(1)` the one outside it, and so on. The binders are `Lam` and the second argument of `Pi`, `Sigma` and `W`. The polymorphic identity $\\lambda A.\\,\\lambda x.\\,x : \\Pi_{A : \\mathcal U_0} \\Pi_{x : A} A$ is written like this:"
msgstr "变量是数字：`Bound(0)` 是最近外层绑定子的变量，`Bound(1)` 是再外一层的，依此类推。绑定子是 `Lam` 以及 `Pi`、`Sigma` 和 `W` 的第二个参数。多态恒等函数 $\\lambda A.\\,\\lambda x.\\,x : \\Pi_{A : \\mathcal U_0} \\Pi_{x : A} A$ 写法如下："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:65
msgid "In the type, the domain of the inner $\\Pi$ is `Bound(0)`, the $A$ bound by the outer $\\Pi$; its codomain is under one more binder, so the same $A$ is `Bound(1)` there. The type of the application is computed by substituting: the kernel applies the codomain closure to the argument's value."
msgstr "在类型中，内层 $\\Pi$ 的定义域是 `Bound(0)`，即外层 $\\Pi$ 绑定的 $A$；其陪域又多处于一个绑定子之下，因此同一个 $A$ 在那里是 `Bound(1)`。应用的类型通过代换计算：内核将陪域闭包应用于参数的值。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:67
msgid "Declare constants in a context"
msgstr "在上下文中声明常量"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:69
msgid "A context lists the types of free variables named `Global(...)`. Use it to postulate a type and an element of it:"
msgstr "上下文列出名为 `Global(...)` 的自由变量的类型。用它来公设一个类型及其一个元素："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:83
msgid "The type of `a` is the value of the term `A`, which is the neutral variable `VNeutral(NFree(Global(\"A\")))`."
msgstr "`a` 的类型是项 `A` 的值，即中性变量 `VNeutral(NFree(Global(\"A\")))`。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:85
msgid "Work with pairs"
msgstr "使用对"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:87
msgid "A pair is checked against a $\\Sigma$ type, and the projections infer their types from it:"
msgstr "对是对照 $\\Sigma$ 类型检查的，投影则从中推断各自的类型："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:101
msgid "Handle type errors"
msgstr "处理类型错误"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:103
msgid "The checker raises `TypeError` with a message that names the failed rule. Catch it like any MoonBit error:"
msgstr "检查器抛出 `TypeError`，其消息指出失败的规则。像捕获任何 MoonBit 错误一样捕获它："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:121
msgid "Use universes and cumulativity"
msgstr "使用宇宙与累积性"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:123
msgid "`Universe(i)` has type `Universe(i + 1)`, and a type in $\\mathcal U_i$ is also accepted in every larger universe:"
msgstr "`Universe(i)` 的类型是 `Universe(i + 1)`，$\\mathcal U_i$ 中的类型在每个更大的宇宙中也被接受："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:140
msgid "`def_eq` is the subtyping test used by the checker, not a symmetric equality."
msgstr "`def_eq` 是检查器所用的子类型测试，而不是对称的相等关系。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:142
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "深入"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:144
msgid "Prove something by path induction"
msgstr "用路径归纳证明命题"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:146
msgid "The eliminator `JElim(A, x, P, d, y, p)` turns a proof `d` of `P x (refl x)` and a path `p : Id(A, x, y)` into a proof of `P y p`. The motive `P` must be an inferable function, so annotate it. Here the motive is constant, $P = \\lambda y.\\,\\lambda p.\\,A$, and $J$ transports `a` along `refl a`:"
msgstr "消去子 `JElim(A, x, P, d, y, p)` 将 `P x (refl x)` 的证明 `d` 和路径 `p : Id(A, x, y)` 转为 `P y p` 的证明。动机 `P` 必须是可推断的函数，因此要对其标注。这里动机是常函数 $P = \\lambda y.\\,\\lambda p.\\,A$，$J$ 沿 `refl a` 传输 `a`："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:165
msgid "Normalise terms and compare them"
msgstr "归一化项并比较"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:167
msgid "The normal form of a term is the read-back of its value. Normalisation reduces under binders, so it decides $\\beta$-equality of terms:"
msgstr "项的范式是其值的读回。归一化会在绑定子之下归约，因此它能判定项的 $\\beta$-相等："

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:183
msgid "The comparison uses the derived `Eq` of `TermChk`, which is $\\alpha$-equivalence because names are indices."
msgstr "比较使用 `TermChk` 派生的 `Eq`，由于名字是索引，它就是 $\\alpha$-等价。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:185
msgid "Check under binders yourself"
msgstr "自己在绑定子之下检查"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:187
msgid "`type_inf_0` covers closed terms. To check a term with free `Bound` variables, call `type_inf` or `type_chk` with the state the checker would have under those binders: the level, a context entry `(Local(k), type)` and an environment entry `val_var(Local(k))` per binder, innermost first."
msgstr "`type_inf_0` 处理闭项。要检查含有自由 `Bound` 变量的项，请以检查器在这些绑定子之下会具有的状态调用 `type_inf` 或 `type_chk`：层级，以及每个绑定子一个上下文条目 `(Local(k), type)` 和一个环境条目 `val_var(Local(k))`，最内层的在前。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:198
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:200
msgid "**Type positions must be inferable.** A type is a `TermChk`, but the formation rules infer the universe of a type, so write `Inf(UnitType)`, not a bare `Lam` or `Pair`, wherever a type goes."
msgstr "**类型位置必须可推断。** 类型是 `TermChk`，但形成规则会推断类型所在的宇宙，因此凡是需要类型的地方都写 `Inf(UnitType)`，而不是裸的 `Lam` 或 `Pair`。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:201
msgid "**Functions need annotations to be inferred.** `Lam(...)` can only be checked. Wrap it in `Ann(lam, Inf(Pi(...)))` to use it in an application or as a motive."
msgstr "**函数需要标注才能被推断。** `Lam(...)` 只能被检查。用 `Ann(lam, Inf(Pi(...)))` 包裹它，才能在应用中或作为动机使用。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:202
msgid "**`W` and `WRec` write the family differently.** In `W(A, B)`, `B` is a body under a binder; in `WRec(A, B, ...)`, `B` is an inferable function term of type $A \\to \\mathcal U_k$."
msgstr "**`W` 和 `WRec` 对族的写法不同。** 在 `W(A, B)` 中，`B` 是绑定子之下的体；在 `WRec(A, B, ...)` 中，`B` 是类型为 $A \\to \\mathcal U_k$ 的可推断函数项。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:203
msgid "**`def_eq` is directed and context-free.** It tests subtyping, and it cannot compare neutral applications such as `f x` because it does not know the type of `f`."
msgstr "**`def_eq` 有方向且不依赖上下文。** 它测试的是子类型，并且无法比较 `f x` 这样的中性应用，因为它不知道 `f` 的类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:204
msgid "**Evaluation trusts its input.** `eval_inf` and the `val_` functions panic on ill-typed terms; type-check first."
msgstr "**求值信任其输入。** `eval_inf` 和 `val_` 函数在类型错误的项上会 panic；请先做类型检查。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:205
msgid "**Print with `Debug`.** The kernel types derive `Debug`, not `Show`: use `debug_inspect`, `Repr(x)` or `@debug.to_string(x)`. Closures print as `<function: ...>`, so quote a value before printing it."
msgstr "**用 `Debug` 打印。** 内核类型派生的是 `Debug` 而非 `Show`：请使用 `debug_inspect`、`Repr(x)` 或 `@debug.to_string(x)`。闭包会打印为 `<function: ...>`，因此打印值之前先对其 quote。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:207
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:209
msgid "The [API reference](../api/elab.md) lists every constructor and function."
msgstr "[API 参考](../api/elab.md)列出了每个构造子和函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:210
msgid "The [design notes](../design/elab.md) give the typing rules in inference-rule notation and explain normalisation by evaluation."
msgstr "[设计说明](../design/elab.md)以推理规则记法给出类型规则，并解释求值归一化。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:211
msgid "The treatise linked from the [overview](../index.md) develops the type theory from the untyped lambda calculus."
msgstr "从[概览](../index.md)链接的论著从无类型 lambda 演算出发发展了该类型论。"

